		NoItemSelected: Select an item to start!
		NotEnoughItem: You don't have enough [i:{0}]!
		FillConfirm: Are you sure you want to fill?
		NoUndos: No changes to undo.
		SelectBlock: Select a block to start!
		NotValidBlock: Select a solid, 1x1 block (like Dirt [i:2]) to start!
		Selected: Placement type set to [i:{0}] ({1})!
